# Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA)

- Semantic landmarks and lists: `<main>`, `<ul>/<li>/<article>`, headings, `<dl>` in the modal.
- Real `<button>` for the card action. Do not make the whole card a clickable `<div>`.
- Decorative card images: `alt=""`. Do not announce the model name twice.
- Loading / empty: `role="status"`. Error: `role="alert"` plus a recoverable action.
- Modal: native `<dialog>.showModal()` (focus trap, Escape, backdrop). Restore focus to the opener on close.
- Visible `:focus-visible` rings. Honour `prefers-reduced-motion` (no stagger animation).
- Description grey must meet 4.5:1 contrast on white. Use `eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y`; do not disable rules without a one-line reason.

```js
// ❌ BAD
<div onClick={open}>XE</div>

// ✅ GOOD
<h2>
  <button type="button" onClick={open}>XE</button>
</h2>
```
